## Case: cross-module-record-template
id: "av.parity.1088.cross-module-record-template"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1088"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use lib.Box
use lib.make
use lib.read
fn main() int {
    let first = make(19)
    let second = Box<int> { value: 23 }
    return read(first) + read(second)
}
```

#### lib.at

```auto
pub type Box<T> { value T }
pub fn make<T>(value T) Box<T> { return Box { value: value } }
pub fn read<T>(box Box<T>) T { return box.value }
```

