## Case: cross-module-record-template-method
id: "av.parity.1088.cross-module-record-template-method"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1088"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use lib.make
fn main() int { let box = make(19); return box.echo(42) }
```

#### lib.at

```auto
pub type Box<T> { value T; fn echo<U>(other U) U { return other } }
pub fn make<T>(value T) Box<T> { return Box { value: value } }
```

